        },
        {
          "text": "Kĩla kũnengwa kũseo na kĩla kũnengwa kwĩthĩanu nikumaa ĩũlũ, kũtheeaa kuma kwa Ĩthe wa syeni, na kwake kũitonyeka kwĩthĩwa kũalyũkĩka, kana kyuu kya kũalyũka. ",
          "type": "text",
